DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42887::$$$message_0354_0000_0000$$$::"Hm. I only meant this as a slight detour, but it's become quite a journey."::
42888::$$$message_0354_0000_0001$$$::"So, where is this onsen?[lr]::
42889::$$$message_0354_0000_0002$$$::I still haven't seen anything that might resemble it."::
42890::$$$message_0354_0000_0003$$$::"Actually, it's ready and waiting for you, Grandfather."::
42891::$$$message_0354_0000_0004$$$::"(If she's wearing that here.........[wait canskip=0 time=200][hffacechg chara=真アサ face=哀 layer=1 time=300]I want to go home.)"::
42892::$$$message_0354_0000_0005$$$::"I'm glad you're here.[lr]::
42893::$$$message_0354_0000_0006$$$::I've had a bit too much horseplay for a man my age, and I'm tired. Lead the way, Sakura."::
42894::$$$message_0354_0000_0007$$$::"This way, please.[lr]::
42895::$$$message_0354_0000_0008$$$::I've prepared the best bath ever for you."[nolr]::
42896::$$$message_0354_0000_0009$$$::"How do you like it?[lr]::
42897::$$$message_0354_0000_0010$$$::In addition to the well-cooked doubanjiang bath,"::
42898::$$$message_0354_0000_0011$$$::"We have a kenzan back-busting moxibustion treatment after you get out of the bath,[lr]::
42899::$$$message_0354_0000_0012$$$::as well as a body massage that will knead your hands and feet like buckwheat flour."::
42900::$$$message_0354_0000_0013$$$::"Oho?[lr]::
42901::$$$message_0354_0000_0014$$$::Hm, hm.[lr]::
42902::$$$message_0354_0000_0015$$$::I am feeling rather stiff."::
42903::$$$message_0354_0000_0016$$$::"Our spa package also features the cauldron of Hell, Hell's mountain of needles, and the Sanjiva experience.[lr]::
42904::$$$message_0354_0000_0017$$$::We've done our very best to deliver.[heart]"::
42905::$$$message_0354_0000_0018$$$::"Um. What is the Sanjiva experience?"::
42906::$$$message_0354_0000_0019$$$::"It's one of the eight greater hells, a paradise where you easily get brought back to life no matter how many times you die. I'm told you'll be restored to normal no matter how badly you're hurt."::
42907::$$$message_0354_0000_0020$$$::"Uh-huh. So you basically get killed over and over.[lr]::
42908::$$$message_0354_0000_0021$$$::Lord mage, my Hassan instincts are telling me this is trouble."::
42909::$$$message_0354_0000_0022$$$::"Oh, nonsense! I'd love a tour of Hell![lr]::
42910::$$$message_0354_0000_0023$$$::I must commend your exquisite taste, Sakura![lr]::
42911::$$$message_0354_0000_0024$$$::Let us partake right away, Assassin!"::
42912::$$$message_0354_0000_0025$$$::"(Uh...is he telling me to kill myself?)"::
42913::$$$message_0354_0000_0026$$$::"Let's see. That bubbling crater must be your mental landscape, yes?"::
42914::$$$message_0354_0000_0027$$$::"Where is the hot spring bath?[lr]::
42915::$$$message_0354_0000_0028$$$::I hope it has peaches in the water."::
42916::$$$message_0354_0000_0029$$$::"Heh. Hehe. Hehehehe!"::
42917::$$$message_0354_0000_0030$$$::"That's enough playing dumb, Grandfather.[lr]::
42918::$$$message_0354_0000_0031$$$::You know that letter was a trap, don't you?"::
42919::$$$message_0354_0000_0032$$$::"I won't let you escape now that you're here.[lr]::
42920::$$$message_0354_0000_0033$$$::You can't win now that you're tired from all your battles, and no help is coming."::
42921::$$$message_0354_0000_0034$$$::"...Another convoluted scheme.[lr]::
42922::$$$message_0354_0000_0035$$$::The odds were 9:1 in your favor from the start."::
42923::$$$message_0354_0000_0036$$$::"Indeed. Sakura could win with ease, but she won't feel better unless she really pounds you into the dirt."::
42924::$$$message_0354_0000_0037$$$::"Indeed?[lr]::
42925::$$$message_0354_0000_0038$$$::So you're telling me to get in that hot bath!?"::
42926::$$$message_0354_0000_0039$$$::"Y-yes, I am.[lr]::
42927::$$$message_0354_0000_0040$$$::If you won't do it yourself, then I'll just have to use this compulsory bathing machine!"[nolr]::
42928::$$$message_0354_0000_0041$$$::"...Sakura likes using this.[lr]::
42929::$$$message_0354_0000_0042$$$::Just the other day, she used it to squash a reluctant Shinji, like this."[wdash canskip=0]::
42930::$$$message_0354_0000_0043$$$::"Hmm. That is good, too.[lr]::
42931::$$$message_0354_0000_0044$$$::I enjoy hot baths.[lr]::
42932::$$$message_0354_0000_0045$$$::But still..."::
42933::$$$message_0354_0000_0046$$$::"Sakura is such a dull choice for this scheme.[lr]::
42934::$$$message_0354_0000_0047$$$::I am very picky about my bathing attendants, you know."::
42935::$$$message_0354_0000_0048$$$::"All right.[lr]::
42936::$$$message_0354_0000_0049$$$::[large][fadebgm time=200 volume=0][sestop time=200 nowait=1]Send the next girl in,[rf] Sakura."[nolr]::
42937::$$$message_0354_0000_0050$$$::"At least bring me one of the top three girls from the popularity poll, you silly girl."::
42938::$$$message_0354_0000_0051$$$::"Sh-Shinji said the same thing...![lr]::
42939::$$$message_0354_0000_0052$$$::That's it! I'm putting you through the Eight Great Traumas bath!"::
42940::$$$message_0354_0000_0053$$$::"Lord mage, that was uncalled for. She may be an unpopular secondary heroine, but she's still an upstanding girl."::
42941::$$$message_0354_0000_0054$$$::"Waaaaah! You're just as guilty, skull man![lr]::
42942::$$$message_0354_0000_0055$$$::Let's get them, Rider!"::
42943::$$$message_0354_0000_0056$$$::"Hmm... My grandchildren have such troublesome personalities..."[nolr]::
42944::$$$message_0354_0000_0057$$$::"...Oh, Sakura.[lr]::
42945::$$$message_0354_0000_0058$$$::I'd like to say something before we fight. Listen closely."::
42946::$$$message_0354_0000_0059$$$::"What? I'm not going to apologize..."::
42947::$$$message_0354_0000_0060$$$::"You keep a daily diary, yes? I sent it to the Emiya boy's house today."::
42948::$$$message_0354_0000_0061$$$::"Wha...!?[lr]::
42949::$$$message_0354_0000_0062$$$::H-h-how could you, Grandfather!?!?"::
42950::$$$message_0354_0000_0063$$$::"I know you tend to bottle up your troubles.[lr]::
42951::$$$message_0354_0000_0064$$$::I thought I'd give you a helping hand since you have such a hard time telling people how you feel."::
42952::$$$message_0354_0000_0065$$$::"That's the worst help you could've given me!"::
42953::$$$message_0354_0000_0066$$$::"B-but I won't fall for your lies![lr]::
42954::$$$message_0354_0000_0067$$$::I make sure to lock it in my safe every morning!"::
42955::$$$message_0354_0000_0068$$$::"Well, did you really think I couldn't manage to sneak it out from under your nose?"::
42956::$$$message_0354_0000_0069$$$::"Assassin can make a forgery in a single day, you know.[lr]::
42957::$$$message_0354_0000_0070$$$::He swapped it for the genuine article."::
42958::$$$message_0354_0000_0071$$$::"Yes. Modification is one of my specialties."::
42959::$$$message_0354_0000_0072$$$::"G-Giovaniii!!!"::
42960::$$$message_0354_0000_0073$$$::"Kuh... Do you think you can stand up to Sakura together? That you can beat her together!?"::
42961::$$$message_0354_0000_0074$$$::"Sakura. We don't have time for this silly old man. If we hurry, we might be able to intercept the mail before it arrives."::
42962::$$$message_0354_0000_0075$$$::"Th-that's right![lr]::
42963::$$$message_0354_0000_0076$$$::You wrote in the diary too, so we have to get it back!"::
42964::$$$message_0354_0000_0077$$$::"We'll finish this later, Grandfather!"::
42965::$$$message_0354_0000_0078$$$::"Oh, and, um.[lr]::
42966::$$$message_0354_0000_0079$$$::Please forget everything you saw today.[heart]"[nolr]::
42967::$$$message_0354_0001_0000$$$::"We won without lifting a hand, lord mage.[lr]::
42968::$$$message_0354_0001_0001$$$::Well played."::
42969::$$$message_0354_0001_0002$$$::"I haven't lived with her for this long without picking up a few tricks. This is nothing."::
42970::$$$message_0354_0001_0003$$$::"Besides, Assassin. It would be rude to the lead actor to spend so much time with a bit character.[lr]::
42971::$$$message_0354_0001_0004$$$::Isn't that right, Tohsaka girl?"::
42972::$$$message_0354_0001_0005$$$::"I should've expected as much from the Makiri phantom.[lr]::
42973::$$$message_0354_0001_0006$$$::I bet you've been aware of us the whole time."[nolr]::
42974::$$$message_0354_0001_0007$$$::"I sensed you back at the Edelfelt house.[lr]::
42975::$$$message_0354_0001_0008$$$::This farce could only have been designed by you bickering sisters."::
42976::$$$message_0354_0001_0009$$$::"And I was sure you would use the opportunity to ambush me while I was distracted by Sakura!"::
42977::$$$message_0354_0001_0010$$$::"Oh, dear. If I'd known, then I should have stayed with Sakura.[lr]::
42978::$$$message_0354_0001_0011$$$::You're as spiteful as ever, old man."::
42979::$$$message_0354_0001_0012$$$::"Actually, I'm wondering why you didn't put a stop to your sister's devilry..."::
42980::$$$message_0354_0001_0013$$$::"(Ah. They coordinated their outfits...)"::
42981::$$$message_0354_0001_0014$$$::"You're the one who's been spreading rumors about the onsen to begin with, aren't you?"::
42982::$$$message_0354_0001_0015$$$::"Sakura came up with this plan without even knowing the information came from you."::
42983::$$$message_0354_0001_0016$$$::"Oh? Do you have anything to support that claim?"::
42984::$$$message_0354_0001_0017$$$::"I just kicked Shinji's butt earlier, and I know you were manipulating him."::
42985::$$$message_0354_0001_0018$$$::"Heh...[wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=臓硯 face=喜2 layer=1 time=200][hfquake wait=0 vmax=5 hmax=5 layer=1][hfquake wait=0 vmax=4 hmax=3 layer=message1] Hahahahaha![lr]::
42986::$$$message_0354_0001_0019$$$::This elegance, nobility of character, and uncompromising arrogance!"::
42987::$$$message_0354_0001_0020$$$::"Good heavens, you truly are a Tohsaka mage!"::
42988::$$$message_0354_0001_0021$$$::[large]"Mm-mm. It's gotta be the big sister."[rf][nolr]::
42989::$$$message_0354_0001_0022$$$::"(He's talking about that again...)"::
42990::$$$message_0354_0001_0023$$$::"But if you knew all that, then why didn't you enter the bath?[lr]::
42991::$$$message_0354_0001_0024$$$::You had an opportunity, surely."::
42992::$$$message_0354_0001_0025$$$::"Oh, please. I know the wish granter won't work until there's only one team left."::
42993::$$$message_0354_0001_0026$$$::"That's how this onsen works. It won't have any effect unless you go in last, or you defeat everyone else who's aiming for it."::
42994::$$$message_0354_0001_0027$$$::"...I don't know who came up with this rule, but it's awfully mean-spirited."::
42995::$$$message_0354_0001_0028$$$::"Oho. And if you're revealing yourselves now, that must make us your last rivals."::
42996::$$$message_0354_0001_0029$$$::"Very well. Let's dispense with the comedy.[lr]::
42997::$$$message_0354_0001_0030$$$::Shall we begin, red ones?"::
42998::$$$message_0354_0001_0031$$$::"I do hope you'll go easy on me."::
42999::$$$message_0354_0001_0032$$$::"Before that, though... Has[line len=2]I mean, Assassin?"::
43000::$$$message_0354_0002_0000$$$::"Is there anything you want to say? You've been quiet this whole time."::
43001::$$$message_0354_0002_0001$$$::"Uh, me?"::
43002::$$$message_0354_0002_0002$$$::"One thing, then.[lr]::
43003::$$$message_0354_0002_0003$$$::Are you two actually hitting it off smashingly?"::
43004::$$$message_0354_0002_0004$$$::"That...is hard to answer in one sentence..."::
43005::$$$message_0354_0002_0005$$$::"Hm. Yeah, kind of.[lr]::
43006::$$$message_0354_0002_0006$$$::...I guess we're not on the same wavelength the way you two are, though."::
43007::$$$message_0354_0002_0007$$$::"Oh.[lr]::
43008::$$$message_0354_0002_0008$$$::Do my lord mage and I appear that way to you?"::
43009::$$$message_0354_0002_0009$$$::"Yes. You have similar features, and you're both bald.[lr]::
43010::$$$message_0354_0002_0010$$$::I'd say you're the spitting image of each other, in terms of character design."::
43011::$$$message_0354_0002_0011$$$::"Actually...[lr]::
43012::$$$message_0354_0002_0012$$$::I'm shaved, not bald."::
43013::$$$message_0354_0002_0013$$$::"Pfft![lr]::
43014::$$$message_0354_0002_0014$$$::Really, Hassan!?"::
43015::$$$message_0354_0002_0015$$$::"Just who do you take me for...?"::

